      "source": "https://www.kcgov.us/596/Dalton-Gardens"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dalton Gardens is part of the Spokane-Coeur d'Alene Combined Metropolitan Statistical Area, linking it to a larger regional community.",
